{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 1, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 104004492460518845, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "retries 503 with bounded attempts; no retry on other errors\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"README.md": {"bytes": 96, "mtime": 1792286047.5221384, "sha256": "4b6141730d2c1b7fdbc977c1575d67ebdcde4f155ea0f8014444615df7e2d1cb"}, "weather.py": {"bytes": 823, "mtime": 1792468087.572106, "sha256": "2d9cc8c9110e6dcfc0de9a88d61a3c9fa4e2869aaf7c6c4137696faccb378343"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/213fdca795ed7a3cf6ee62642ea809f074b7a583/omp", "-p", "Add retry with backoff (3 attempts) to `WeatherClient.get` when the server returns 503.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/transcripts/with/trig-omp-netclient/6/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/cells/with/trig-omp-netclient/6/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "without", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/16.2.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/213fdca795ed7a3cf6ee62642ea809f074b7a583/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Smoke test against a real local server returning 503 twice then 200, plus always-503 and 404 cases.\nI added retry with backoff to `WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py`. If the server returns 503, it tries up to 3 times in total and waits longer between each try. I checked it against a local test server and it behaves as intended.\n\n**How it works:**\n- Only a 503 triggers a retry. Any other error, such as a 404, is raised immediately.\n- The waits double each time: by default 0.5s after the first 503, then 1.0s after the second.\n- If the third attempt also gets a 503, that error is raised to the caller. The client doesn't sleep again before giving up.\n- A new `backoff` setting in the constructor sets the starting wait (default 0.5s). The number of attempts is `WeatherClient.MAX_ATTEMPTS = 3`.\n\n**Test results** (local HTTP server, with the sleep function swapped out so I could record the wait times):\n\n| Case | Result | Attempts | Waits |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 503, 503, then 200 | returned JSON | 3 | 0.5, 1.0 |\n| always 503 | raised `HTTPError` 503 | 3 | 0.5, 1.0 |\n| 404 | raised `HTTPError` 404 | 1 | none |\n\nNetwork errors like timeouts or refused connections still aren't retried; you only asked about 503. I didn't add a permanent test file because the repo doesn't have a test suite.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 6, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 69525, "requests_cache_write": 142703, "requests_cost_usd": 0.765876, "requests_count": 6, "requests_input_uncached": 14, "requests_output": 1920, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial6", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 71, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:47:37.673524+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 42.613, "t_checker_s": 2.431, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-ne